,"Exit 6; walk toward Sejong-daero"],["1","Jonggak","Exit 1; approximately 350 metres toward Gwanghwamun"]],"note":"Routes follow the official visitor guide. Check current station access and transport information before travelling."},{"type":"timeline","title":"Plan your performance visit","items":[{"date":"1","title":"Choose a performance","body":"Check the date, time, venue, age restrictions and language information on the individual listing."},{"date":"2","title":"Book through the official service","body":"The official English booking guide describes email verification, date and seat selection, and payment. Online booking usually closes two hours before the performance; exceptions apply."},{"date":"3","title":"Check collection and cancellation rules","body":"Use the instructions supplied with your confirmed booking. An enquiry or saved request does not issue a ticket."}]},{"type":"prose","title":"Accessibility and assistance","paragraphs":["The official accessibility guide describes tactile guidance, assistance call buttons, wheelchair lifts and elevators. Contact the centre before your visit to confirm a suitable entrance and assistance for your venue.","For current ticket availability and confirmed booking information, follow the official English links below."]},{"type":"links","title":"Official English information","items":[{"label":"What''s on","href":"https://www.sejongpac.or.kr/eng/performance/engperformance/performList.do?menuNo=700007"},{"label":"How to purchase tickets","href":"https://www.sejongpac.or.kr/eng/main/contents.do?menuNo=700089"},{"label":"Public transport and maps","href":"https://www.sejongpac.or.kr/eng/main/contents.do?menuNo=700040"},{"label":"Accessibility information","href":"https://www.sejongpac.or.kr/eng/main/contents.do?menuNo=700018"},{"label":"English guided backstage tour","href":"https://www.sejongpac.or.kr/eng/main/contents.do?menuNo=700092"},{"label":"Official English homepage","href":"https://www.sejongpac.or.kr/eng/main/main